{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first game from Vacation Home,\u00a0<strong><i>Foldy\u2019s OS Quest</i></strong> invites players into a colorful computerized world for an action-packed 3D platforming adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Foldy</strong> is a carefree anti-virus file folder, living blissfully on the Digital Desktop. But when a massive virus invades his peaceful operating system, spreading its influence to all corners of his world, Foldy must spring into action with the help of his newfound companion, Mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, zip, surf and stomp your way through levels inspired by the magical world of personal computing, and take down the virus before it can break through the Firewall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore seven uniquely themed levels, each one based around a unique corner of Foldy's digital world, from desktop games to social media and even down into the darkest depths of the Recycle Bin!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up collectibles to unlock challenging bonus levels, the ultimate test of your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return to previously cleared levels to try your hand at Time Trials, and unlock new moves to bring your times down even further!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532060?t=1742226369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532060?t=1742226369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532060/dbaea35d6bfcd8a7f4dadf6f235ccbdaa1d96c69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742226369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532060/dbaea35d6bfcd8a7f4dadf6f235ccbdaa1d96c69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742226369","categories":[{"description":"Si